@startuml
title MS2 · Participants — Modèle de classes (S4)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam ClassBorderColor #2E5A88
skinparam ArrowColor #2E5A88
skinparam FontName Helvetica
skinparam FontSize 12
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D9A400

enum ApplicantType <<enumeration>> {
  DEVELOPER
  TEAM
}

enum ApplicationStatus <<enumeration>> {
  PENDING
  ACCEPTED
  REJECTED
  WITHDRAWN
}

class Developer <<aggregate>> {
  +id: UUID
  +keycloakId: String
  +displayName: String
  +email: String
  +skills: List~String~
  +createdAt: LocalDateTime
  --
  +create(DeveloperCreate data): Developer {static}
  +findByKeycloakId(String id): Developer {static}
  +updateSkills(List~String~ skills): void
  +isSkilledIn(String skill): boolean
}

class Team <<aggregate>> {
  +id: UUID
  +name: String
  +ownerId: UUID
  +memberIds: List~UUID~
  --
  +create(TeamCreate data): Team {static}
  +addMember(UUID developerId): void
  +removeMember(UUID developerId): void
  +isMember(UUID developerId): boolean
  +size(): int
}

class Application <<entity>> {
  +id: UUID
  +challengeId: UUID
  +applicantType: ApplicantType
  +applicantId: UUID
  +status: ApplicationStatus
  +registeredAt: LocalDateTime
  --
  +register(UUID challengeId, UUID applicantId, ApplicantType type): Application {static}
  +accept(): void
  +reject(): void
  +withdraw(): void
  +isActive(): boolean
}

class Challenge <<external>> {
  +id: UUID
  +deadline: LocalDateTime
  +status: String
}

Developer "1" --> "0..*" Application : soumet (DEVELOPER)
Team "1" --> "0..*" Application : soumet (TEAM)
Team "1" --> "1" Developer : ownerId
Team "1" --> "0..*" Developer : memberIds
Application --> ApplicantType : applicantType
Application --> ApplicationStatus : status
Application ..> Challenge : challengeId (réf.)

note right of Developer
  Profil créé de façon idempotente
  sur keycloakId (409 si déjà existant).
  Base H2 dédiée à MS2.
end note

note bottom of Application
  challengeId est une référence externe
  vers MS1 : aucun FK inter-services.
  Un seul inscrit par (challengeId, applicantId).
  L'inscription publie application.registered.
end note

legend bottom left
  <<external>> : entité possédée par MS1, référencée par son identifiant.
end legend
@enduml
